{"id":"665563","name":"猪肚山药排骨汤","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/665563/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肚","amount":"适量"},{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"山药","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"适量"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪肚提前处理清洗干净。","img":"images/665563/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"排骨和猪肚冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净。","img":"images/665563/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洗净的猪肚和排骨放入珐琅锅中。","img":"images/665563/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入胡椒粉或者胡椒粒，再加入适量清水。","img":"images/665563/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盖上大火煮开后转小火煲40分钟左右。","img":"images/665563/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"山药洗净去皮备用。","img":"images/665563/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"分钟左右将猪肚捞出。","img":"images/665563/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"猪肚改刀切小块。","img":"images/665563/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"切好的猪肚放回汤锅中。","img":"images/665563/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入山药。","img":"images/665563/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入红枣。","img":"images/665563/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"煮开继续中小火煲15分钟左右。","img":"images/665563/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"出锅前放入枸杞，少许盐调味即可。","img":"images/665563/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/665563/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/665563/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/665563/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/665563/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}